## How the 4 Next Steps Fit Together

```
Problem                    →   Solution
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
1 LB per service = $$      →   Ingress + ALB Controller (1 LB total)
Nodes don't auto-scale     →   Karpenter (nodes in/out automatically)
YAML copy-pasted everywhere →  Helm (one chart, many environments)
Hardcoded AWS keys in pods →   IRSA (IAM role per pod, auto-rotating)
```

