## Common Mistakes & Fixes

| Mistake | Fix |
|---------|-----|
| `ImagePullBackOff` | ECR login expired or wrong image URL — recheck `$REGISTRY` and re-login |
| Pod stuck `Pending` | No space on nodes — check `kubectl describe pod` for resource pressure |
| `EXTERNAL-IP` pending forever | Wait 3 min; if still pending check node IAM role has LB permissions |
| `exec format error` | Image built for wrong CPU arch — rebuild with `--platform linux/amd64` |
| `kubectl` not working | Run `aws eks update-kubeconfig --name demo-test --region ap-south-1` |
| Karpenter installs but no nodes | Controller IAM role missing or IRSA not set up for controller |
| Old `ingress.class` annotation | Use `spec.ingressClassName: alb` instead |
| `$REGISTRY` empty in new terminal | Re-run the variable assignments from ECR step |

